        <mxCell id="note" value="Evidence limits: Adapter 1 (NAT) is recorded disabled on both VMs. Admin Adapter 4 and target Adapters 3–4 were not documented. The adapter record does not prove guest routing or complete egress isolation. The ZIP was copied to the admin VM; its deployment as the target seed is unverified." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3F5F7;strokeColor=#AAB5C0;fontColor=#34495E;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
